  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You create dozens of illusory mirrors to bewilder up to three creatures of your choice that you can see within range.</p><p>Each target makes an Intelligence saving throw. On a failure, it takes 7d6 Psychic damage and has the &amp;Reference[stunned apply=false]{Stunned} condition, and while Stunned, its Speed is halved. On a success, it takes half as much damage only.</p><p>A Stunned target repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the spell on itself on a success.</p>",
